 "title": "Others",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Others</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"In the Others section of purchase requisitions, additional information such as, subcontractor or classification details can be changed.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"In the Others section of purchase requisitions, additional information such as, subcontractor or classification details can be changed.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page concept  - topic-topic concept-concept \" id=\"loio1698f43fcec34afbb6396faa4881051b\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Others</h1><div class=\"body conbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">In the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Others</span> section of purchase requisitions, additional\ninformation such as, subcontractor or classification details can be changed.</p>\n<div class=\"p\">In the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Others</span> section, the fields available are based on your\norganization and they may allow you to make changes to the following fields:<ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio1698f43fcec34afbb6396faa4881051b__ul_xcx_vlk_t1c\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Commodity Code</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Is Subcontractor</span><aside class=\"note\" id=\"loio1698f43fcec34afbb6396faa4881051b__note_bc2_3wk_t1c\" aria-labelledby=\"n0t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n0t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p>For more\ninformation on using subcontractors, see <a class=\"xref\" href=\"e2a0f3ecf6f64198966ee10d6c803ac7.html#loioe2a0f3ecf6f64198966ee10d6c803ac7__subcontractor_supplier\">Guidelines for Using Subcontractors as Suppliers</a> .</p></aside></div></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Item Category</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Material Group</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Payment Terms</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Additional Supplier Email Addresses</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Incoterms Code</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Incoterms Location</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Purch Org</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Line Item Text</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Tax Code</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Contract Workspace ID</span></p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Contract</span></p><aside class=\"note\" id=\"loio1698f43fcec34afbb6396faa4881051b__note_edx_vlk_t1c\" aria-labelledby=\"n1t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n1t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p class=\"p\">If you're using contracts for the item or service, you can find the\ncontract number by selecting<span class=\"ph menucascade\"><img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navstart.gif\" alt=\"Start of the navigation path\" title=\"Start of the navigation path\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Contract</span>&nbsp;<img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navstep.gif\" alt=\"Next navigation step\" title=\"Next navigation step\">&nbsp;<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Browse all</span><img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navend.gif\" alt=\"End of the navigation path\" title=\"End of the navigation path\"></span>. Avoid using the recent-contracts list, because it could\ncontain contracts for other suppliers.</p></aside></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Other Limit</span></p></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}